<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! sense.hallway.reads ~ the hallways: entity pairs that recur together

`lares sense structure <wing>` reads the entity-pair hallways of one wing on one plane (`--lens`, default content), each pair seen at least `--min-count` times (default 2). A leading sensorium name (`lares sense <sensorium> <verb>`) addresses any named sensorium; bare, the verb reads `memory`.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ structure

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`structure` params=`wing/claude ~ the hallways of one wing`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ wing · lens · min-count

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`wing` params=`takes/name needs/required seat/1 as/<wing> ~ the wing`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`lens` params=`takes/plane default/content ~ the plane: content, structure, form, persistence, a named sensorium's own, or crossplane`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`min-count` params=`takes/count default/2 ~ the fewest co-occurrences a pair needs`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ rides the daemon's composed caps, the single-owner law; this handler checks no ocap of its own`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · verb-error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[sense.hallway.reads wing/claude]] ~ no wing named`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`verb-error` params=`~ an unknown lens, or the plane holds no hallways`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

